    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i was reading about sourdough and i'm a bit confused about the biology part. can u explain how the lactobacillus and the yeast actually work together? like what's the actual interaction that makes the dough rise and get sour?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
