    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. so the yeast does the rising and the bacteria does the sour bit. but do they ever fight each other? like is there any point where the bacteria might actually kill off the yeast or something like that? im just wondering how they stay in balance so the dough doesnt just go bad.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
